35,2,1,talk,Servas,,"- **Servas**: The south rooms stay warm, but the others need heat early.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Midori,,- **Midori**: That settle took forty minutes and five demands. I can see why reminders feel like accusations now.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Minato,,"- **Minato**: It took three weeks to settle the newcomers, and part was just written off.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,May,,"- **May**: The quote is thirty-four thousand yen per room, plus annual checks. That is a steep upfront cost.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Daisuke,,#### Turn 1 of 4,"{""words"":5,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Servas,,- **Servas**: Forty minutes of demands each month. That is a heavy price for a simple bill.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Midori,,- **Midori**: And the kitchen notice stayed up all summer. People sweated rather than argue over a pooled bill.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Minato,,- **Minato**: So the old rules really didn’t fit when we got more people.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,May,,"- **May**: @Daisuke, what did you find? I need to know if the paperwork swallows your evenings.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Daisuke,,- **Daisuke**: The template meant keying in every invoice and computing five refunds separately. It is a lot of work.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Servas,,"- **Servas**: @May, that upfront cost is steep, but I worry a fixed rate might make us ignore the cold.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
